# Gold Points Project

Legacy AngularJS 1.x + Express/Sequelize full-stack app for Bering Air Gold Points membership management.

## Key paths

- Client: `client/app/` (features), `client/components/` (shared)
- Server API: `server/api/<resource>/` (controller, model, index router)
- DB init: `server/sqldb/index.js`
- Route registration: `server/routes.js`

## Agent behavior

- Match existing generator-angular-fullstack patterns; minimize diff scope.
- Use Grunt (`grunt serve`, `grunt build`, `npm test`) — not modern bundlers.
- Preserve legacy DB column names (`userId`, `gpType`, `associatedAccounts`, etc.).
- Webhook routes (`/api/transactions/webhooks`) mount before CSRF — keep that order.
- See `AGENTS.md` for full architecture and domain context.
